    body: "| | Character level | Monster Level |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Grows from | EXP | Monster Level XP from kills |\n| Gives you | Class points and passive points | New biomes, dungeons, a bigger rune grid, harder daily missions |\n| Boosted by EXP Gain | Yes | No |\n\n## Points from character level\n\n- **Passive points:** one per character level. Spend them in the [[passive-tree|passive tree]].\n- **Class points:** one at level 1, then one more every 3 levels, up to 100. Spend them in your [[classes-overview|class tree]].\n\n## What Monster Level changes\n\nMonster Level determines which areas and activities you can access. See [[ml-unlocks|what each Monster Level unlocks]] and how to [[monster-level|raise it efficiently]].",
